  m_Name: DienPhanCuSO4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VLAB.ChemistryLab::VLAB.ChemistryLab.ChemistryExperimentDefinition
  experimentId: copper-electrolysis
  displayName: "\u0110i\u1EC7n ph\xE2n CuSO\u2084"
  learningObjective: "Quan s\xE1t s\u1EF1 \u0111i\u1EC7n ph\xE2n dung d\u1ECBch CuSO\u2084
    v\u1EDBi \u0111i\u1EC7n c\u1EF1c tr\u01A1 v\xE0 d\u1EF1 \u0111o\xE1n s\u1EA3n
    ph\u1EA9m \u1EDF m\u1ED7i \u0111i\u1EC7n c\u1EF1c."
  safetyNote: "\u0110eo k\xEDnh/g\u0103ng tay; ch\u1EC9 thao t\xE1c ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n
    \xE1p th\u1EA5p v\xE0 kh\xF4ng ch\u1EA1m \u0111i\u1EC7n c\u1EF1c khi \u0111ang
    c\u1EA5p \u0111i\u1EC7n."
  requirements:
  - "L\u1EAFp \u0111\xFAng anode/cathode."
  - "D\xF9ng ngu\u1ED3n DC 6,0 V an to\xE0n."
  - "Ghi m\xE0u dung d\u1ECBch v\xE0 l\u1EDBp \u0111\u1ED3ng b\xE1m \u1EDF cathode."
  procedureSteps:
  - "Mang PPE v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m tra ngu\u1ED3n \u0111i\u1EC7n \xE1p th\u1EA5p."
  - "R\xF3t CuSO\u2084 v\xE0o b\xECnh \u0111i\u1EC7n ph\xE2n."
  - "\u0110\u1EB7t hai \u0111i\u1EC7n c\u1EF1c tr\u01A1, n\u1ED1i \u0111\xFAng c\u1EF1c
    ngu\u1ED3n."
  - "B\u1EADt 6,0 V, quan s\xE1t \u0111\u1ED3ng b\xE1m cathode v\xE0 hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    t\u1EA1i anode."
  expectedObservation: "Cathode c\xF3 l\u1EDBp \u0111\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ECF n\xE2u;
    dung d\u1ECBch xanh nh\u1EA1t d\u1EA7n v\xE0 anode c\xF3 b\u1ECDt kh\xED."
  resultLabel: "Hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng"
  targetResult: "Cu b\xE1m cathode"
